sc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/alignment_of\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>alignment_of</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   obtains the type's alignment requirements  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/aligned_storage\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>aligned_storage</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-deprecated-cxx23\">(deprecated in C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  defines the type suitable for use as uninitialized storage for types of given size <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Member types","id":"Member_types"},{"depth":3,"text":"Helper types","id":"Helper_types"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member constants","id":"Member_constants"},{"depth":3,"text":"Possible implementation","id":"Possible_implementation"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"types","title":"Type support (basic types, RTTI)"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::aligned_union","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Provides the nested type type, which is a trivial standard-layout type of a size and alignment suitable for use as…"},{"label":"Member types","children":[{"label":"type","note":"a trivial and standard-layout type suitable for storage of any type from Types"}]},{"label":"Helper types"},{"label":"Member constants","children":[{"label":"alignment_value","note":"the stri